        "body": "## Summary\n\n- materialize canonical thread and revision evidence only from fully hydrated inputs\n- refresh unchanged and reverted revision observations without losing source-time ordering\n- keep summaries and embeddings bound to the latest thread revision\n- expose partial cluster coverage when fresh evidence is incomplete or intentionally limited\n- add portable-store, summary, retry, and failure-path coverage\n\n## Validation\n\n- `GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=1 GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=commit.gpgsign GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=false GOWORK=off go test ./... -covermode=atomic -coverprofile=/tmp/gitcrawl-coverage.out`\n- `go tool cover -func=/tmp/gitcrawl-coverage.out` (`85.0%` statements)\n- `GOWORK=off go vet ./...`\n- `gofmt -l $(rg --files -g '*.go')`\n\n## Release notes\n\n- updated `CHANGELOG.md` and portable-store/enrichment documentation\n",
